      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فِرَّةٌ</span></b>  <i>A smiling:</i> [or rather <i>a manner of smiling:</i>]
one says, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إنَّها لَحَسَنَةُ الفِرَّةِ</span> [<i>Verily she is beautiful
